# Vendored Vega builds are hashed byte-for-byte (sha256 lock in test/items.jl
# plus the SRI constants in src/js_runtime.jl): check them out verbatim on
# every platform — no CRLF conversion on Windows.
# (Without this, windows-latest CI checks out CRLF bytes and the 6 hash
# asserts fail while Linux/macOS stay green.)
/vendor/*.min.js -text
